  storyText: "The Fixer\n\n\"Kaz Okoro. Small-time fixer, big-time heart.\" His optics click as they scan you. \"Simple gig. Courier a package to Pacifica tonight. 1,000 eb on delivery.\"\n\n\"My usual runner, Nix, is late. You'll do.\"\n\n1. \"I'm in.\"\n2. \"What's in the package?\"\n3. \"Not interested.\""
